hey everyone.  Im new to all this but I was able to get opengd77 installed onto a gd77 and a gd77s.  i wanted to use the gd77s as the hotspot. Its working but its proving a little challenging.   Couple of things I can figure out without a screen.  Im using Blue DV on windows also. <br><br>I never figured out how to put the gd77s into hotspot mode, so i just put a hotspot zone, and hotspot channel into the code plug and it seems to be working (sort of)<br><br>1st, It seems like the usb connection is maybe flakey or something.  BlueDV drops the connection when I TX often.  I key up and the color on bluedv doesn't change, but the gd77s turns led green.  flipping serial on and off makes tx works again, but then I lose RX. <br><br>2nd, when im RXing from a talk group, I see bluedv activate but nothing comes out of the radio (no red light) then, after a bit, eventually there is a substantially long break in the transmissions from a net, and all of a sudden it starts to work and I can hear on my gd77. I have no idea why this pause seems to make it work. <br><br>Also, I cant figure out how to reduce the power and its getting quite warm.   <br><br>any help would be very much appreciated.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=8761">KJ5IWB</a> — Fri Jun 13, 2025 3:35 am</p><hr />
